        "length_unit.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies the unit in which the length will be calculated.</p><ul><li><span title=\"FEET_US\">Feet (United States)</span>—Length in feet (United States)</li><li><span title=\"METERS\">Meters</span>—Length in meters</li><li><span title=\"KILOMETERS\">Kilometers</span>—Length in kilometers</li><li><span title=\"MILES_US\">Miles (United States)</span>—Length in miles (United States)</li><li><span title=\"NAUTICAL_MILES\">Nautical miles (United States)</span>—Length in nautical miles (United States)</li><li><span title=\"YARDS\">Yards (United States)</span>—Length in yards (United States)</li></ul></xdoc>",
